<span id="A2.T4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Note:</span> For InternVL-2.5, the IFD score <em id="A2.T4.5" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">monotonically decreases</em> as model size increases (2B <math id="A2.T4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> 38B).
